<title>SRI LANKA: Hayles says nine-month net up 14.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Hayles says nine-month net up 14.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Hayleys Ltd Ltd for the nine months to 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 5,256.46   vs	 4,080.23</p>
<p>     Net profit	 176.22   vs	   153.27</p>
<p>     Tax		  127.08   vs	   117.29</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Hayleys Ltd is one of three diversified holding companies listed in Colombo. Its businesses include trading, plantation management, textiles, rubber products and activated carbon.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
